<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93409" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σᾰτίνη</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], ἡ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>chariot</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιῆσαι σατίνας καὶ ἅρματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Ven.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιβαίνει σατινέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anacr.
					21.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σατίναις ὐπ᾽ ἐϋτρόχοις ἆγον
					αἰμιόνοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					20a13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζυγίους ζευξάσᾳ θεᾷ σατίνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					1311
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.): only found in pl. (sg. in <i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i> l.c. codd.).—<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> cites <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάτιλλα</span></b> ,=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πλειάς</span>, the constellation
			being regarded as <i>a car.</i></div>
